<title>UK: Friesland Bank sets 250 mln guilder 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Friesland Bank sets 250 mln guilder 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRIESLAND BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    23.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.806   PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.231    SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC   1.575</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 5.75 PCT FEB 2007 AND 8.25 PCT</p>
<p>			    SEPT 2007 DSLS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
